      802     else do:
      803       for each out-vatp_gds-dtlcl where out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.doc-code  = pardoc-code  and
      804                                          out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.artic     = parartic     and
      805                                          out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.prod-type = parprod-type and
