     1916       run clcprtsl_calc-ttable in this-procedure
     1917         (input yes,
     1918          input yes,
     1919          input bf_doc-line.road-tax,
     1920          input bf_doc-line.excise,
     1921          input bf_doc-line.vat-pc,
     1922          input bf_doc-line.cons-vat-pc,
